# Copy to `SCRIPT_DIR/.env` or point SYNC_ENV_FILE here.
# SYNC_IGNORE_* entries are repo-relative under each .cursor root (e.g. rules/foo.mdc).
# Export the same variables in your shell before running the script to override file values.

# Required for a real run unless you pass --root-2:
# CURSOR_ROOT_2=/path/to/other/.cursor

# Skip copying these from root 2 into root 1 (paths that should stay only under root 2).
# Multiple paths: separate with colon (:), not commas — e.g. rules/a.mdc:rules/b.mdc
# SYNC_IGNORE_2_TO_1=rules/example.mdc

# Skip copying these from root 1 into root 2. Same format: colon-separated if you list several.
# SYNC_IGNORE_1_TO_2=
